at"},{"surface":"நாண்","parts":[{"text":"நாண்","lemma":"நாண்","gloss":"honour"}],"gloss":"honour"},{"surface":"உடை","parts":[{"text":"உடை","lemma":"உடை","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"நெடுந்தகை","parts":[{"text":"நெடும்","lemma":"நெடு","gloss":"great"},{"text":"தகை","lemma":"தகை","gloss":"nobility"}],"gloss":"great noble man"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"வலம்","parts":[{"text":"வலம்","lemma":"வலம்","gloss":"victory"}],"gloss":"victory"},{"surface":"படு","parts":[{"text":"படு","lemma":"படு","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having"},{"surface":"தானை","parts":[{"text":"தானை","lemma":"தானை","gloss":"army"}],"gloss":"army"},{"surface":"வேந்தற்கு","parts":[{"text":"வேந்தன்","lemma":"வேந்தன்","gloss":"king"},{"text":"கு","lemma":"கு","gloss":"to"}],"gloss":"to the king"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உலந்துழி","parts":[{"text":"உலந்துழி","lemma":"உலந்துழி","gloss":"when perished"}],"gloss":"when perished","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உலக்கும்","parts":[{"text":"உலக்கும்","lemma":"உல","gloss":"who will perish"}],"gloss":"who will perish"},{"surface":"நெஞ்சு","parts":[{"text":"நெஞ்சு","lemma":"நெஞ்சு","gloss":"heart"}],"gloss":"heart"},{"surface":"அறி","parts":[{"text":"அறி","lemma":"அறி","gloss":"knowing"}],"gloss":"knowing"},{"surface":"துணையே","parts":[{"text":"துணை","lemma":"துணை","gloss":"companion"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"companion indeed"}]}],"literal":"Like a male wild cat, with a frightened look and a soft head, / eating bird's flesh, with a flesh-smelling wide mouth, / the children of the white-mouthed hunters and their beloved wives, / with the small-leaved uṭai tree's hollow-sheathed white thorns, / and arrows fitted with fine reed shafts, / bending the strong bow made of thin sticks, / watching for bandicoots near the cotton fence, / in the small village of beautiful hamlets surrounded by dry lands, / where the white gaping mouths of sheep that ate kumil fruits are opened, / under the strong-pillared arbor spread with white shining flowers, / in the light of the small fire kindled by the shepherd, / the great noble man of honour sat with the bards, / to the king of the victorious army, / he is indeed a heart-knowing companion who will perish when the king perishes.","translation":"In the small village of beautiful hamlets surrounded by dry lands, children of white-mouthed hunters and their beloved wives—who look like male wild cats with frightened gazes and soft heads, and have wide, flesh-smelling mouths from eating bird-meat—bend strong bows made of thin sticks, fitting arrows with fine reed shafts and white thorns from the hollow sheaths of small-leaved uṭai trees, to watch for bandicoots near the cotton fences. There, under a strong-pillared arbor spread with white shining flowers, where sheep open their gaping white mouths after eating kumil fruits, a great noble man of honour sits with bards in the light of a small fire kindled by a shepherd. To the king of the victorious army, he is indeed a true, heart-knowing companion who will perish when his king perishes.","modern":"காட்டுப் பூனையின் ஆண் போன்ற மிரண்ட பார்வையும் மென்மையான தலையும் உடைய, பறவையின் இறைச்சியைத் தின்று புலால் நாற்றம் வீசும் அகன்ற வாயைக் கொண்ட, வெண்மையான வாயையுடைய வேட்டுவர்களின் அன்பான மனைவியரும் பிள்ளைகளும், சிறிய இலைகளையுடைய உடை மரத்தின் துளையுள்ள வெண்மையான முட்களையும், நாணலின் மெல்லிய கோல்களையும் கொண்டு தொடுத்த அம்புகளை, வளைந்த வில்லில் பூட்டி, பருத்தி வேலியருகே ஓடும் பெருச்சாளிகளைப் பார்த்துக் கொண்டிருப்பர். அத்தகைய புன்புல நிலத்தால் சூழப்பட்ட அழகிய குடிகளைக் கொண்ட சிறிய ஊரில், குமிழ் பழங்களைத் தின்ற ஆடுகள் தம் வெண்மையான பிளந்த வாய்களைத் திறக்கும்படியாக, வெண்மையான பூக்கள் பரவிய வலிமையான தூண்களையுடைய பந்தலின் கீழ், இடையன் மூட்டிய சிறிய நெருப்பின் வெளிச்சத்தில், பாணர்களோடு அமர்ந்திருக்கும் மானமுடைய பெருந்தகை, வெற்றி பொருந்திய படையையுடைய வேந்தனுக்கு, அவன் அழியும்போது தானும் அழியும் நெஞ்சறிந்த துணையாவான்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Vākai tiṇai and Vallāṇ Mullai tuṟai, which celebrates the strength and loyalty of a warrior from the dry forest region. The poet Alattur Kilar describes a small, rustic village surrounded by dry lands, where hunter families live a rugged life, hunting bandicoots near cotton fences with simple bows and arrows. In this humble village, under an arbor where sheep rest, the local chieftain sits with bards around a small fire lit by a shepherd. Despite his simple lifestyle, this noble chieftain is a fierce warrior and a deeply loyal companion to his king. The poem emphasizes that he is a true friend who will not hesitate to lay down his life on the battlefield when his king perishes.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.42],[0.42,0.96],[0.96,1.7],[1.7,2.65],[2.76,3.1],[3.1,3.5],[3.5,3.7],[3.7,4.3],[4.3,5.5],[5.5,5.9],[5.9,6.5],[6.5,7.0],[7.0,7.9],[7.9,8.25],[8.25,8.61],[8.61,8.96],[8.96,9.14],[9.14,9.5],[9.5,9.85],[9.85,10.1],[10.1,12.2],[12.2,12.8],[12.8,13.57],[13.57,13.8],[13.8,14.5],[14.5,14.8],[14.8,15.1],[15.1,15.9],[15.9,16.7],[16.7,17.19],[17.19,17.8],[17.84,18.0],[18.68,19.38],[19.38,19.78],[19.78,20.08],[20.08,20.28],[20.28,21.08],[21.08,21.3],[21.46,21.92],[21.92,22.28],[22.28,22.78],[22.78,23.28],[23.28,23.88],[23.88,24.51],[24.58,25.18],[25.18,25.78],[25.78,26.18],[26.18,26.78],[26.78,27.88],[27.88,28.18],[28.18,28.88],[28.88,29.53],[29.53,30.17],[30.17,30.69],[30.69,31.08]],"female":[[0.0,0.7],[0.7,1.1],[1.1,1.87],[1.87,2.5],[2.5,3.1],[3.1,3.7],[3.7,3.9],[3.9,4.5],[4.5,5.8],[5.8,6.2],[6.2,6.61],[6.69,7.1],[7.1,8.3],[8.3,8.5],[8.5,9.02],[9.02,9.55],[9.55,9.81],[9.81,10.33],[10.33,11.07],[11.07,12.2],[12.2,12.42],[12.85,13.82],[13.82,14.15],[14.15,14.8],[14.8,15.1],[15.1,15.6],[15.6,15.9],[15.9,16.1],[16.1,16.54],[16.54,16.9],[16.9,18.3],[18.62,19.1],[19.72,20.42],[20.42,20.82],[20.82,21.12],[21.12,21.32],[21.32,21.83],[21.83,22.09],[22.09,23.62],[23.7,23.92],[23.92,24.57],[24.57,25.22],[25.22,25.82],[25.82,26.45],[26.52,27.62],[27.62,27.82],[27.82,28.22],[28.22,28.82],[28.82,30.22],[30.22,30.42],[30.42,31.22],[31.22,32.02],[32.42,32.88],[32.88,33.25],[33.25,33.52]]},"sync":[[["வெருக்கு","wild cat"]],[["விடை","male"],["அன்ன","like"]],[["வெருள்","frightened"],["நோக்கு","look"],["கயம்","soft"]],[["கயம்","soft"],["தலை","head"]],[["புள்","bird"],["ஊன்","flesh"]],[["தின்ற","eaten"]],[["புலவு","flesh-smell"],["நாறு","smelling"]],[["கயம்","wide"],["வாய்","mouth"]],[["வெள்","white"],["வாய்","mouth"]],[["வேட்டுவர்","hunters"]],[["வீழ்","beloved"],["துணை","companion"]],[["மகாஅர்","children"]],[["சிறியிலை","small-leaved"]],[["உடையின்","of the uṭai tree"]],[["சுரையுடை","having a hollow sheath"]],[["வால்முள்","white thorn"]],[["ஊகம்","reed"]],[["நுண்","fine"],["கோல்","shaft"]],[["செறித்த","fitted"]],[["அம்பின்","with arrow"]],[["வலாஅர்","thin stick"]],[["வல்","strong"],["வில்","bow"]],[["குலாவர","to bend"],["கோலி","having bent"]],[["கோலி","having bent"]],[["பருத்தி","cotton"]],[["வேலி","fence"]],[["கருப்பை","bandicoot"]],[["பார்க்கும்","watching"]],[["புன்","dry"],["புலம்","land"]],[["தழீஇய","surrounded"]],[["அம்","beautiful"],["குடி","hamlet"],["சீறூர்","small village"]],[["சீறூர்","small village"]],[["குமிழ்","kumil fruit"],["உண்","eating"]],[["வெள்ளை","white"],["பகுவாய்","gaping mouth"]],[["பகுவாய்","gaping mouth"]],[["பெயர்த்த","opened"]],[["வெண்வாழ்","white shining flower"]],[["தாய","spread"]],[["வண்கால்","strong-pillared"]],[["பந்தர்","arbor"]],[["இடையன்","shepherd"]],[["பொத்திய","kindled"]],[["சிறு","small"],["தீ","fire"]],[["விளக்கத்து","in the light"]],[["பாணரொடு","with bards"]],[["இருந்த","who sat"]],[["நாண்","honour"],["உடை","having"]],[["நெடுந்தகை","great noble man"]],[["வலம்","victory"],["படு","having"]],[["தானை","army"]],[["வேந்தற்கு","to the king"]],[["உலந்துழி","when perished"]],[["உலக்கும்","who will perish"]],[["நெஞ்சு","heart"],["அறி","knowing"]],[["துணையே","companion indeed"]]]}